{"version":1,"content":"<p>作為人類首張黑洞照片，距地球約5500萬光年、質量超太陽60億倍的M87星系中心超大質量黑洞(M87*黑洞)被形象稱為「甜甜圈」的圖像，自7年多前發佈以來廣受關注，學界對其獨特環狀結構是否存在也有爭議。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1586064.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:03:50.563723+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T09:42:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T09:57:12.043256+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T09:57:12.043256+00:00","content_hash":"a1e293f7be7f9cc2d48691e24c25fa902f9201f16b46e3340603a7552facbbd1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}